@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Benchmark Case Contract - Detail

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false

class BenchmarkCase {
  case_id
  task_type + difficulty
  prompt + context
  target_output.format
}

class ExpectedAnswer {
  required_concepts
  forbidden_concepts
  acceptable_variants
  gold_labels
}

class Scoring {
  max_points
  rubric
}

BenchmarkCase *-- ExpectedAnswer : judge-only
BenchmarkCase *-- Scoring

note bottom of BenchmarkCase
Only prompt, context, and requested
output shape reach the target model.
end note

@enduml
